    "chunk_text": "igilhweorfa nemne\u00f0 by\u00fe cenned on f\u00e6ttum landum & heo hafa\u00f0 leaf neah swylce mistel, \u00fea beo\u00f0 ruge & brade, & heo hafa\u00f0 s\u00e6d sinewealt & \u00fe\u00e6t by\u00f0 Wi\u00f0 ealra n\u00e6ddercynna slitas & wi\u00f0 scorpiones genim \u00feysse wyrte wyrttruman eliotropos, syle Heo frema\u00f0 mycelon. Wy\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t wyrmas ymb \u00feone nafolan on \u00feam inno\u00f0e derigen genim \u00f0as ylcan wyrte & ysopan & Heo acwelle\u00fe \u00f0a wyrmas. Wi\u00f0 weartan genim \u00feas ylcan wyrte & sealt, cnuca tosomne, lege to \u00feam weartan. Heo hy fornime\u00fe. \u00deanon heo eac uerrucaria genemned is. Speritis. \u00d0eos wyrt \u00f0e man spreritis & o\u00f0rum naman nemne\u00fe h\u00e6f\u00f0 gehw\u00e6de leaf & ge\u00f0ufe, & heo of anum Wi\u00f0 \u00feone colan fefor genim \u00feas wyrte spreritis, seo\u00f0 on ele; & to \u00f0am \u00f0e se fefor to \u00f0am men Wy\u00f0 wedehundes slite genim \u00feas ylcan wyrte, cnuca to duste, nim \u00f0onne anne cuculere fulne, syle He by\u00f0 hal. Wy\u00fe miltan sare genim \u00feysse sylfan wyrte anne godne gripan & anne sester fulne meolce, wyll Seo milte by\u00f0 gelacnud. Aizos. \u00d0eos wyrt \u00fee man ayzos minor & odrum naman nemne\u00fe by\u00f0 cenned on wagum & on st\u00e6nigum & heo of anum wyrttruman manega gehw\u00e6de bogas asende\u00fe & \u00fea beo\u00f0 fulle of gehw\u00e6dum leafum & \u00feysse wyrte wyrttruma ys un",
